PEN SIZE 

ARROWUP - INCREASE SIZE - E075 - gonna use key = 8'hAA
ARROWDOWN - DECREASE SIZE - E072 - gonna use key = 8'hDD


=========== HOST TO KEYBOARD COMMAND ===========
FA = ACK (acknowledge) (keyboard to host)

HEXCODE --------------- FUNCTIONALITY
F4                      Keyboard Enable: clears output buffer, enables keyboard, returns ACK
                                        keycodes will be transmitted !!
F5                      Keyboard Disable: resets keyboard, disables keyboard, returns ACK
                                        keycodes will NOT be transmitted !!

